From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DoomGuy41 <DoomGuy41@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:37:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] HEVC playback (MP4 hvc1/hev1/hvcC, Matroska V_MPEGH/ISO/HEVC,
 OMXCodec, ACodec, csd-0)

The Venus decoder of the Android 11 OMX core handles HEVC: teach the KitKat extractors and
codec glue about it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/media/stagefright/MediaDefs.h         |  1 +
 include/media/stagefright/MetaData.h          |  1 +
 media/libstagefright/ACodec.cpp               |  3 ++
 media/libstagefright/MPEG4Extractor.cpp       | 31 +++++++++++++++++++
 media/libstagefright/MediaDefs.cpp            |  1 +
 media/libstagefright/OMXCodec.cpp             | 27 +++++++++++++++-
 media/libstagefright/Utils.cpp                | 27 +++++++++++++++-
 .../matroska/MatroskaExtractor.cpp            | 14 ++++++++-
 8 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/media/stagefright/MediaDefs.h b/include/media/stagefright/MediaDefs.h
index 85693d4..58f7e9b 100644
--- a/include/media/stagefright/MediaDefs.h
+++ b/include/media/stagefright/MediaDefs.h
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_IMAGE_JPEG;
 
 extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_VP8;
 extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_VP9;
+extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_HEVC;
 extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_AVC;
 extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_MPEG4;
 extern const char *MEDIA_MIMETYPE_VIDEO_H263;
diff --git a/include/media/stagefright/MetaData.h b/include/media/stagefright/MetaData.h
index 3a87474..272f3f3 100644
--- a/include/media/stagefright/MetaData.h
+++ b/include/media/stagefright/MetaData.h
@@ -53,6 +53,7 @@ enum {
     kKeyESDS              = 'esds',  // raw data
     kKeyAACProfile        = 'aacp',  // int32_t
     kKeyAVCC              = 'avcc',  // raw data
+    kKeyHVCC              = 'hvcc',  // raw data (HEVCDecoderConfigurationRecord)
     kKeyD263              = 'd263',  // raw data
     kKeyVorbisInfo        = 'vinf',  // raw data
     kKeyVorbisBooks       = 'vboo',  // raw data
